        components: ['Pressure Shell - containment','Support Structure - saddles or legs','Relief Valve - overpressure protection','Pressure Gauge - monitoring','Level Indicator - inventory','Inlet/Outlet Valves - isolation','Manway - inspection access','Nameplate - design data'],
